## Project layout

```text
pinterest-downloader/
├── pyproject.toml
├── README.md
├── LICENSE
├── run.bat / run.sh
├── src/pinterest_dl/
│   ├── cli.py            # CLI entry
│   ├── client.py         # HTTP session
│   ├── extractor.py      # HTML / JSON media extraction (images + videos)
│   ├── downloader.py     # concurrent HQ downloads
│   ├── service.py        # orchestration
│   ├── urls.py           # URL / pinimg / video helpers
│   ├── models.py
│   └── web/              # FastAPI UI
└── tests/
```

