## Changelog

### 1.1.0

- Download **videos** (progressive MP4, prefer 720p) alongside poster images
- Direct `v1.pinimg.com/...mp4` URLs
- CLI Type column; web VIDEO badge; recent-files lists `.mp4`
- Extractor: `videos.videoList` / `videoUrls` (works even when `isVideo` is false on idea pins)

### 1.0.1

- Native folder save dialog on web/CLI download

### 1.0.0

- Initial release: HQ image downloader (CLI + web UI)

